-edge\" data-from=\"learn\" data-to=\"capture\" data-curve=\"curve\"></li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"exp\" data-to=\"hub\" data-curve=\"straight\" data-line=\"dashed\" data-change=\"added\"\n      >results</li\n    >\n  </ol>\n</figure>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Loop, interactive","html":"<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-loop-live\" data-diagram-action=\"prev\"\n    >Previous</button\n  >\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-loop-live\" data-diagram-action=\"next\"\n    >Next</button\n  >\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-loop-live\" data-diagram-action=\"clear\"\n    >Clear</button\n  >\n  <output class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-loop-live\"\n    >Click a box or an arrow - or press Next.</output\n  >\n</div>\n<figure class=\"diagram\" id=\"dg-loop-live\" data-interactive data-type=\"loop\" aria-label=\"The product learning loop\">\n  <figcaption class=\"diagram-caption\">\n    <span class=\"diagram-eyebrow\">Loop</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-title\">Every pass improves the shared record</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-dek\">Work goes clockwise; each station writes back to the hub (dashed).</span>\n  </figcaption>\n  <div class=\"diagram-canvas\" style=\"--n: 6\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"hub\" data-tone=\"muted\" data-hub>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Product memory</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\">one record · every loop</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"capture\" style=\"--i: 0\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Capture</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\">signals in</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"research\" style=\"--i: 1\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\